[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025464\">5050B34</a> (left and\nright sides)</p><p>1. Remove the covers.</p><p>2. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>3. Release the inner retainers using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.015.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Remove left trim (4a) followed by right trim (4b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005449.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is undamaged.</p><p>Fit right trim, then left trim and do up\nthe inner retainers.</p><p>Tighten the bolts and fit the covers.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025464\">5050B34</a> (left\nand right sides)</p>"]]